      "content": "thanks for that, but i'm a bit confused by the \"arcane arts\" and \"mystical fog\" talk. i'm just trying to debug a production pipeline, not cast spells lol.\n\ncan we stick to the actual technical details? also, i think those sysctl commands might not work directly inside a standard Dockerfile due to permission restrictions on unprivileged containers. is there a way to inspect the host's dmesg or journalctl from within the agent to see if the OOM killer actually hit us, or should i just be looking at the node's logs directly?",
